Subject: [PATCH 2/2] docs: say what fetchTask does on a network error

---
 README.md | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 5a1b2c3..6d7e8f9 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,7 @@
 ## fetchTask
 
 Loads one task by id.
+
+A network error is retried once, a quarter of a second later. A second
+failure, or any error status from the server, rejects with the status in
+the message.
